OL,3,GNEWSA'I just can't understand why they
OL,4,Aspiked me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was loud music, dancing, flashing
OL,7,Flights and bank holiday fun when,
OL,8,Fsuddenly, Laila Everett was "on the
OL,9,Ffloor" and she "couldn't move and
OL,10,Fcouldn't talk".
OL,12,FThe 21-year-old believes she was spiked
OL,13,Fby an injection.
OL,15,F"I could hear everybody talking to me
OL,16,Fbut my mouth wouldn't move," she said.
