OL,3,GNEWSA'I just can't understand why they
OL,4,Aspiked me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEverett, from Hull, also suffered from
OL,7,Fsevere vomiting. She was taken to
OL,8,Fhospital in an ambulance and woke up
OL,9,Fwith a small red mark on her shoulder,
OL,10,Fwhich is where she believes she was
OL,11,Finjected.
